    "No exact native-cadence H4 pair exists in the fixed sampled panel, so prospective H4 reversal quality remains UNKNOWN here.",
    "On the distinct pre-existing Fold2 TA direction-only model and fixed Jan-Mar2025 later rows, prospective M5 state-turn AUC moves 0.457503 at INITIAL to 0.541573 at FINAL on 531 certified pairs. Paired day and week AUC-gain intervals exclude zero; paired Brier change is negative in both. This is scoped training response on reused development, not independent Edge.",
