    "Fold2 M15 prospective turn gain also has positive paired day/week AUC intervals, but FINAL level intervals include 0.5. Fold2 D1 FINAL AUC is 0.475422 with wide intervals, unlike the earlier Fold1 PASS2 point estimate. Different periods and training recipes prevent causal attribution to regime, head, target or indicators.",
